        "original_id": "da8edc65-9cb9-5cec-a754-c81901708374",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Louis Zamperini, Spencer Lofranco\n- Works: Unbroken, Dixieland\n- Roles: Olympian, army officer, prisoner of war survivor, Christian evangelist, Olympic distance runner, Harry Brooks, Billy\n\nFacts:\n- Louis Zamperini was born on January 26, 1917.\n- Louis Zamperini was a US prisoner of war survivor in World War II, a Christian evangelist, and an Olympic distance runner.\n- The film Unbroken revolves around the life of USA Olympian and army officer Louis \"Louie\" Zamperini.\n- Spencer Lofranco co-starred as Harry Brooks in the biographical war drama Unbroken in 2014.\n- Spencer Lofranco co-starred as Billy in the crime drama Dixieland in 2015.\n- Louis Zamperini died on July 2, 2014.",
